                {
                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT_SET_ANIMATION_SPEED",
                    "args": {
                        "speedIn": 1,
                        "speedOut": 2,
                        "speed": 2,
                        "allowFastForward": true
                    },
                    "id": "ccd463f8-121d-447d-96c0-585ecb4c7c9e"
                },
                {
                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                    "args": {
                        "text": [
                            "I met a traveller\nfrom an antique \nland, who said:",
                            "Two vast      \nand trunkless legs\nof stone lie in the\ndesert.",
                            "beneath them,   \nin the sand,   \nhalf sunk,",
                            "a shattered visage\nlies.",
                            "whose frown,   \nand wrinkled lip,",
                            "and sneer  \nof cold command,",
                            "tell that its\nsculptor well those \npassions read which \nyet survive...",
                            "stamped   \non these...",
                            "LIFELESS   \nTHINGS.",
                            "With a hand that \nmocked them.   \nand a heart \nthat fed;",
                            "and on the pedestal   \nthese words appear:",
                            "\"MY NAME,   \nIS OZYMANDIAS--\"",
                            "\"--KING,   \nOF KINGS\"",
                            "\"LOOK UPON MY WORKS\nYE MIGHTY,   \nAND DESPAIR!!!\"",
                            "nothing beside \nremains...",
                            "round that decay,   \nof that colossal\nwreck, boundless,\nand bare...",
                            "the lone    \nand level sands...",
                            "Stretch far away."
                        ],
                        "avatarId": "",
                        "__collapse": false
                    },
                    "id": "0cc043e0-96a0-4ae5-b00f-5683e72f7ed2"
                },
                {
                    "command": "EVENT_MUSIC_STOP",
