                                        "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                                "mom: your finally \nup, Kris!",
                                                "Kris: *yawn* good\nmorning, mom.",
                                                "mom: I need you to\ndo me a favor.",
                                                "Kris:  already?   \nin the morning? ",
                                                "mom: I know, Im \nsorry, its just\nbeen so hard to",
                                                "manage these \nerrands since your \nfather left.",
                                                "Kris: ...\nWhere has he been \nanyway?",
                                                "its been eight \nyears.",
                                                "mom: ...",
                                                "I just need you to \nhunt some food for \nsupper tonight.",
                                                "just head to the \nforest and hunt one \nboar.",
                                                "that should be \nenough for tonight.",
                                                "dont forget your \nbow!",
                                                "-recieved your bow-"
