                    "collisionGroup": "",
                    "symbol": "actor_99",
                    "script": [
                        {
                            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                            "args": {
                                "text": [
                                    "-a ruler is laid\ncrooked on the\ndesk-",
                                    "-as if someone was\nin a hurry to \nleave-"
                                ],
                                "avatarId": ""
                            },
                            "id": "dfc627ca-7c56-4fba-bb9e-6694acbe31e7"
                        }
                    ],
                    "startScript": [],
                    "updateScript": [],
                    "hit1Script": [],
                    "hit2Script": [],
                    "hit3Script": [],
                    "id": "d4da228e-29bb-49a8-92ae-420b76e72220",
                    "x": 11,
                    "y": 10
                },
                {
                    "name": "",
                    "frame": 0,
                    "animate": false,
                    "spriteSheetId": "c2e0ae89-8637-4e1c-88d2-a9b1fa1e35c2",
                    "direction": "down",
                    "moveSpeed": 1,
                    "animSpeed": 15,
                    "paletteId": "",
                    "isPinned": false,
                    "persistent": false,
                    "collisionGroup": "",
                    "symbol": "actor_100",
                    "script": [
                        {
                            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                            "args": {
                                "text": [
                                    "-a diary-",
                                    "-the faded ink on \nthe cover reads:\n\"wilson smith\"-",
                                    "Kris: what the \nhell?! thats my \ndad!!",
                                    "why does he have a \nhouse way out of \ntown?",
                                    "what did he write\nin here?",
                                    "-pg.1: oct.18, 1347 \n\"today, research \nwas great. my \nstudies lead me",
                                    "to belive that this\n'snow' substance\nfalls from the sky\"",
                                    "\"its like rain, but\nit freezes up into \nlittle parts of ice",
                                    "making the snow \nfall slower than \nrain.\"",
                                    "\"If only I had \naccess to the real\nworld, I could \nlearn so much more\"",
                                    "\"if only...\"",
                                    "pg.2: oct 19 \n\"today, I plan to\nleave the walls. \njust for the day,",
                                    "and not too far \nout. me and\nmr.booker have a",
                                    "plan for creating a\nhidden pathway.\ntommorow, I'll \nreport back what I",
                                    "find. but this must\nstay a secret from\nmy friends and \nfamily\"",
                                    "pg.3: oct 20\n\"the real world was\namazing!! so many\ndifferent lands and",
                                    "creatures! my \nresearch had a \nbreakthrough, which\nI'll record in my",
                                    "science journal for\norganization.\"",
                                    "\"I plan on making \nthese journeys\nregular, tommorow,\nI will make a ",
                                    "longer trip alone.\"",
                                    "pg.4: oct 21\n\"today I write from\nthe woods outside\nthe walls. I may",
                                    "have to end up \nstaying here for a \nwhile, I need to\nkeep exploring.\"",
                                    "pg.5: (undated)\n\"today outside of\ntown, I ran into \na mysterious \nhostile creature.",
                                    "its body seemed to\nlook like shadows,\nif that makes sense",
                                    "Ive found shelter \nway outside of town\nwith old documents\nof past generations",
                                    "what Ive learned\nis purely amazing.",
                                    "I dont plan on\ngoing back home for\na couple years.\"",
                                    "pg.6: (undated)\n\"after realizing\nive left my science\njournal back home,",
                                    "I must record what \nIve learned here."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": ""
                            },
                            "id": "57580590-7098-47b9-a035-16db2929038d"
                        },
                        {
                            "command": "EVENT_MUSIC_PLAY",
                            "args": {
                                "musicId": "a3b99559-32f0-4f21-abec-80c7b6cb8592"
